#
#	riscv64-specific files
#
#	Only the atomics are hand-written: an instruction the compiler has
#	no word for is an assembly function here, as getcallerpc is.  The
#	rest is the portable C, which is correct and slow, and that is the
#	right order to do it in.
#
TARGFILES=\
	ainc-riscv64.$O\
	getfcr-riscv64.$O\
	frexp-386.$O\
	memmove.$O\
	memset.$O\
	nan-386.$O\
	strchr.$O\
